# repeated-else-if-condition (#8): the same condition text repeats in one if/else-if
# chain -- the later branch is unreachable. Fires on the third branch's condition
# 'X = 1' (line 10) which repeats line 6; NOT on the first 'X = 1' (line 6), the
# distinct 'X = 2' (line 8), nor the separate chain's 'X = 6' (line 14).
repeated-else-if-condition 10
!repeated-else-if-condition 6
!repeated-else-if-condition 8
!repeated-else-if-condition 14
